## Test Keys Replacement Required
All provided Example Keys within this directory merely serve as illustrative
examples only for the Recipient's internal reference. The Recipient shall
generate its own secure keys before deploying any application to a production
environment or any commercial context. Recipient's failure to replace these
keys with secure, production-grade keys may compromise the security of its
application and shall be at its own risk.

